<title>POLAND: POLISH C.BANK SAYS NO OPERATION ON WEDNESDAY.</title>
<headline>POLISH C.BANK SAYS NO OPERATION ON WEDNESDAY.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-07-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The National Bank of Poland said</p>
<p>it would not stage any open market operation on Wednesday.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
